3. Evidence ledger and typed graph contract

Every investigation uses a stable investigation ID and an explicit evidence / hypothesis / prediction / test / result separation. Store sensitive source material by private reference, not by copying secrets into the ledger.

Proposed interchange envelope (JSON example; descriptive schema, not yet enforced by code):

