6. Native Pantheon integrations

• Semantic Order of Operations: parse reference, scope, dependency and relation before abstraction.
• Semantic PCA: extract salient latent axes only after preserving causal/semantic structure; keep a loss ledger.
• Delta Calculus / Recursive Delta Observatory: classify residuals; detect missing variables and regime changes.
• History Stereoscope: multiple concurrent interpretations, primary-source provenance, reversible reenactments.
• Pantheon Painter Inverse/Forward Atelier: infer plausible process, render candidates, compare traces, reject overconfident stroke recovery.
• Growth Grammar: infer nucleation, templating, accretion, differentiation, feedback, selection, preservation, transformation; verify mechanisms domain by domain.
• Semantic LiDAR / Resolution Modulation: traverse macro/meso/micro views and uncover obscured interfaces.
• Indigo Hammer: challenge brittle assumptions and models without indiscriminately destroying useful context.
• Theseus Ark Stone / Bootloader: preserve identifiers, constraints, invariants, failed tests, and a reconstruction seed when replacing implementations.
• Civilizational Transition Layer: allow native/local interpretations to remain sovereign; translate consequences without erasing differences or forcing a monoculture.

Portability rule: ARKFORGE speaks in stable contracts and operators; adapters may change. The Pantheon is the orchestration and epistemic layer, not an excuse to reinvent Ghidra, REA, simulators, or scientific instrumentation.

