The ideas of inverse problems, system identification, abductive reasoning, causal inference, model-based testing, and minimum-description-length reasoning have broader research histories. ARKFORGE combines them into a Pantheon-specific operating protocol; it does not claim to invent those fields or establish scientific validity by naming them.

Reconstruction checksum, in words: Specify the frame. Preserve the trace. Separate fact from hypothesis. Infer operators. Predict forward. Test safely. Observe the delta. Revise with provenance. Transfer only what survives validation.

